---
const values = [
  'Honestidad en el diagnóstico y reparación',
  'Compromiso con la seguridad del cliente',
  'Innovación constante',
  'Respeto por el medio ambiente',
  'Trabajo en equipo',
];
---

<section id="mision" class="section mission">
  <div class="section-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="floating-shape floating-shape--md" style="top: 18%; left: 6%; animation-delay: 0s"></span>
    <span class="floating-shape floating-shape--sm" style="top: 62%; right: 8%; animation-delay: 2s"></span>
    <span class="floating-shape floating-shape--lg" style="bottom: 12%; left: 12%; animation-delay: 4s"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="container mission-inner">
    <div class="mission-header">
      <span class="section-label reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0s">Nuestra identidad</span>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.12s">Misión, visión y valores</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mission-grid">
      <article class="mission-card mission-primary card-lift reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.08s">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Misión</h3>
        <p>
          Brindar servicios automotrices integrales, con altos estándares de calidad, utilizando tecnología de diagnóstico avanzada y personal calificado para garantizar la seguridad, el rendimiento y la satisfacción total de nuestros clientes. Nos comprometemos a ofrecer soluciones confiables, rápidas y transparentes que prolonguen la vida útil de cada vehículo.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mission-card card-lift reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.2s">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Visión</h3>
        <p>
          Ser un taller automotriz líder en la región, reconocido por la excelencia en el servicio, la innovación tecnológica y la confianza de nuestros clientes; consolidándonos como la primera opción en mantenimiento y reparación de vehículos en la ciudad de Medellín.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mission-card mission-values card-lift reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.32s">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Valores corporativos</h3>
        <ul class="values-list">
          {values.map((value, i) => (
            <li class="reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${0.4 + i * 0.08}s`}>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/>
              </svg>
              {value}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .mission::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-strong), transparent);
  }

  .mission-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .mission-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .mission-header .section-label {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .mission-header .section-label::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .mission-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    height: 100%;
    transition:
      opacity 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      transform 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      border-color 0.3s ease,
      background 0.3s ease,
      box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    transition-delay: var(--reveal-delay, 0s);
  }

  .mission-card.is-visible {
    transition:
      opacity 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      transform 0.3s ease,
      border-color 0.3s ease,
      background 0.3s ease,
      box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    transition-delay: 0s;
  }

  .mission-primary {
    border-color: rgba(1, 7, 56, 0.15);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(1, 7, 56, 0.06) 0%, var(--bg-card) 40%);
  }

  .card-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: rgba(1, 7, 56, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .mission-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .mission-card p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .values-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .values-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .values-list svg {
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
